{
 "_comment": "In-run upgrades as a tree growing from the thing (ui/tree.ts). tree: branch, parent (a node, «thing» the centre, «hub» the gate of the special materials that opens with the first one absorbed), x/y on the board (the thing at 0,0), kind (core: no cap, its effect doubles at each milestone level; small; key: a keystone that changes a rule; choice: one of a pair, the other closes for the run), max (levels; none for core), needMax (the parent taken to the end first), pair, icon. A node opens when its parent has a level (or is full, with needMax), its epoch has come (era) and its pair is not taken. Branch pile (energy): pileSize adds sand.pile.perLevel particles to a tapped pile; the others with pileMat are the composition of the piles (share per level, all shares at most sand.pileShareMax). price = base * growth^level. effect.kind: add (value*level) or mul (value^level).",
